  "description": "After being betrayed and cast aside by her company, genius producer Jang Hye-Ri will stop at nothing to prove her worth. The perfect chance seems to fall into her lap when she meets Seok-Pil, a handsome stranger who asks her to turn him and his four friends into idols. The catch? All five of them are cursed to become cats and can only become human with enough love and care. Faced with her greatest challenge yet, does Hye-Ri have what it takes to lead these felines to fame?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
